  "text": "Hi all — Professor Alvarez would like to set up next week's CSE455 staff meeting. Could each of you send me your availability next week, Monday–Friday, between 09:00 and 17:00? Please give me the blocks when you're free (and note any that are definitely out). I'll find a slot that works for everyone and confirm.",
